 very helpful when playing a  solo Lane against melee champions  undertow has good area damage making it  good for clearing drill waves and a  crucial investment on ko City and Gotham  divided learning which might have  Atlantis follow-up to use and when is  all part of mastering Aquaman surge is a  powerful initiator especially against  enemy marksman and supports wrath is a  powerful finishing move so prioritize  low health enemies capsized can help you  escape  or throw an enemy out of position  setting up a tidy kill while rising  tides bonus damage scales with power  damage its healing skills with attack  damage keep this in mind when building  Aquaman artifacts with power damage like  star Heart and cosmic staff afford  Aquaman high burst damage and a more  lethal poke with trident of the King his  low cooldowns make it easy to burn  through will  so consider artifacts with extra will or  will regeneration for extra health and a  little crowd control pick up Atlanta and  Royal Seal built with attack damage  rising tide gives you sustained damage  and health recovery attack damage also  increases under toes ability to clear  drone waves  try huntresses crossbow for cooldown  reduction anatomic accent Kota blade for  more attack damage and penetration for  some extra durability pickup metallus  heart or fragment of Mogo Aquaman  super strength gives you a short move  speed boost after throwing an object  this stolen power shines in scenarios  when you're looking to surprise from the  jungle or escape when outmatched rule  the land in the seven seas as Aquaman  Lord of Atlantis
 

